cff-version: 1.2.0
title: BC Wildfire Susceptibility Explorer
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  manuscript listed under preferred-citation.
type: software
abstract: >-
  An interactive Google Earth Engine application that serves calibrated,
  uncertainty-aware wildfire susceptibility map products for British Columbia:
  a relative susceptibility score from 0 to 1, a five-class equal-area version
  of that score, and an Area of Applicability mask. The application provides a
  per-pixel click readout of the nine model predictors, a transect chart and
  polygon statistics. It serves the finished map products only and does not
  distribute the input rasters.
